    "id": "M2_current_office_assignment_and_postal_area_visualization",
    "definition": "Current rights-cleared complete-for-declared-coverage four-digit Posta Shqiptare assignments with stable row identity, edition, validity, schema and SHA-256 must reproducibly produce an approved immutable artifact and pass the actual AL AGID loader, API and app. A drawable postal area must be an exact official Polygon/MultiPolygon or a clearly derived surface from complete permitted address/road members; it retains authority, official/derived/virtual class, basis date, confidence, omissions and uncertainty and passes normalized search, all result/failure states, fit, translucent fill, clear outline and clear/re-search. Office locations, cadastral asset rows/zones, address points, roads, buildings, parcels, routes, P.O. boxes, buffers, Voronoi cells, learned regions and AGID cells cannot become official full-code polygons. House numbers and buildings require separate permitted stable address relations. Synthetic fixtures, format examples, public webpages and metadata alone never establish M2."
